{
  "_note": "Monsters wave 1 (docs/specs/monsters-wave1.md). Merged into DB at load (core/db.gd: _merge_creatures): 'materials' -> DB.materials, 'bodies' -> DB.bodies, 'creatures' -> DB.races (with creature:true; each gets its own body plan '<plan>_<id>' = the base plan with the creature's 'coat' layers laid over every part whose outer layer is skin), 'factions' -> DB.factions (wild:true), 'names' -> DB.names. A creature is body plan + tissue layers + natural attacks + tokens + size + rarity; no HP, no special-case combat. Tags: [DF] Dwarf Fortress inspired, [ours] our own (tuned, flagged).",
  "_format": "creature: {name, plural, body (plan id), coat [layers laid over skin], mass kg, height/width (sprite scale), tiers/attrs (DF attribute tiers), gait [sprint, run, jog] (DF ticks per 100 tiles), skills {skill: [lo, hi]}, personality medians, attacks [{verb, type edge|blunt, contact, penetration, p (base momentum, x sqrt(torque x mass ratio) like punch/kick), v (m/s), prep, rec, w, needs: part id prefix, latch: bite-and-hold via the grab code, charge: momentum = CHARGE_K x mass x run speed, mat: material of tooth/claw/tusk, stagger}], tokens [NOPAIN NOSTUN NOEXERT NOFEAR FAST_HEAL] (NOFEAR -> never routs), rarity common|uncommon|rare|epic|legendary, wave, unlock {day, fights}, group [min, max], lair (lair kind), roam px around the lair (0 = stays put), power (map strength per unit), trophies [{name, gold, part (lost part -> no trophy), coat (value x intact coat)}], art (CreaturePainter shape keys), size_tiles (multi-tile bodies, later waves; 1 now), enabled. Later waves: multi-head / long-neck plans are ordinary part lists (head_1..head_7 each with its own neck parent); 'size_tiles' > 1 and breath attacks ('breath': {shape, dmg}) are hooks only.",

